 "translation": "Rahat broke the silence. \"Rehana, today I am convinced that you are truly something. I used to call you eccentric and argumentative, but today, forgive me, forgive me. You tell me, I will listen to you. Tell me, I will break my racket tomorrow itself. Why should I break it? And my conscience... I won't play tennis anymore. I won't marry him. I will tell him, 'Now you give up this idea, and now you don't need to look for ring designs anymore.'\" Rahat's tone was filled with tenderness and regret. \"I expected this from you. Tomorrow I will go to Kishwar and definitely free her from the clutches of this hawk. Will you come? Why, you will come, won't you?\"",
